    "updated_at": "2017-08-16T09:39:26Z",
    "body": "I created a small test for this:\r\nhttps://rednoize.su/vtt-bug/updtest-same.html\r\nand ran it on different implementations. The results are:\r\nChromium 59: cues are not cleared after setting the same URL as it was\r\nSafari 10.1.2: cues are not cleared after setting the same URL as it was\r\nFirefox 54.0.1: cues are not cleared after setting the same URL as it was\r\nMS Edge 38.1439: cues are not cleared after setting the same URL as it was",
