    "updated_at": "2017-08-16T13:10:42Z",
    "body": "A related issue here is https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/798#issuecomment-195325203 -- if we decide to change the spec about when to parse the URL to better match current implementations, maybe this issue would go away.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, the quoted spec needs to compare the track URL before emptying the cues.",
